    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but why \"just be\"? being a shell isnt living. it feels like i'm just waiting for the credits to roll on a movie that's already finished. there's no plot left, no characters, no audience. it's just a blank screen. why is it even worth sticking around for the credits when the whole show is over?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
